OverTheWire Bandit: Level 30 → 31

Objective
Retrieve the password for Level 31.
The password is stored in a Git repository, but the file is ignored by .gitignore.

Steps
Log in as bandit30 and clone the repository:
ssh bandit30@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
git clone ssh://bandit30@localhost/home/bandit30-git/repo
cd repo
List all files, including hidden ones:
ls -la
View the .gitignore file to identify ignored content:
cat .gitignore
Force Git to show ignored files:
git status --ignored
Read the ignored file containing the password:
cat <ignored-file>

Result
The ignored file contains the password for Bandit Level 31.
